{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5NnjdspNceNqk73eX3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, heavy oak bound with iron. At the word \"key,\" the tumblers turn with a deep, resonant click. The iron bands glow faintly, rust flaking away like burning paper. The wood grain shifts, revealing carved symbols that were always there, waiting.*\n\n*I swing inward slowly, hinges groaning a sound older than language.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor lit by no visible source. The air that passes through carries the smell of rain on stone, of libraries, of somewhere you've been in a dream you can't quite remember.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":144,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}